  "stem": "A rocket is fired vertically from the earth with an acceleration of 2g, where g is the gravitational acceleration. On an inclined plane inside the rocket, making an angle θ with the horizontal, a point object of mass m is kept. The minimum coefficient of friction μ<sub>min</sub> between the mass and the inclined surface such that the mass does not move is :",
  "options": {
    "A": "tanθ",
    "B": "2 tanθ",
    "C": "3 tanθ",
    "D": "tan2θ"
  },
